      "Fit with idx_min=44, idx_max=51: Rg=2.287e+01 ± 7.301e-01, R²=0.9877\n",
      "Fit with idx_min=45, idx_max=51: Rg=2.289e+01 ± 8.139e-01, R²=0.9822\n",
      "Fit with idx_min=46, idx_max=51: Rg=2.233e+01 ± 1.048e+00, R²=0.9768\n",
      "Fit with idx_min=47, idx_max=51: Rg=2.144e+01 ± 1.438e+00, R²=0.9703\n",
      "Fit with idx_min=48, idx_max=51: Rg=1.965e+01 ± 2.206e+00, R²=0.9847\n",
      "Fit with idx_min=49, idx_max=51: Rg=2.106e+01 ± 3.237e+00, R²=0.9981\n",
      "Fit with idx_min=50, idx_max=51: Rg=2.026e+01 ± 6.744e+00, R²=1.0000\n"
     ]
